  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Increasing the Socio-Economic Integration of Migrant Workers in Rana and Oslo Regions through Development of a Pre-Departure and Post-Arrival Orientation E-Course</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Rana Municipality in the Nordland Region of Norway and Oslo Region are actively seeking to expand their workforce by attracting international migrant workers and taking measures to support their social and economic integration. To enhance this effort, IOM proposes to collaborate with Rana and Oslo to create a pre-departure/post-arrival orientation e-course, designed to equip migrant workers with essential knowledge about life in Norway, including information about labor rights, the legal system, public services, and the local context, thereby facilitating their successful integration and long-term contribution in local communities.</narrative>
  </description>
